WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.330
<b>I'm not going to die.</b>

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.290
<b>We've been in my world for a long time.</b>

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.880
<b>And I rule it!</b>

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.300
<b>This…</b>

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.380
<b>This is…</b>

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.260
<b>a world of ice?</b>

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.100
<b>You saved our skin, Icemen.</b>

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:27.230
<b>Thanks to your Spirit Allies,
we'll be able to pull this off.</b>

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.400
<b>It's going to get pretty cold,
just to warn you.</b>

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:34.700
<b>Though I guess this world is nothing</b>

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.990
<b>to people who grew up
in cold countries like us.</b>

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:43.000
Unyielding wish that rises in my chest

