00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:13.490
<b>Episode 35</b>

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:13.490
<b>Episode 35</b>

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:13.490
<b>Reunion</b>

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:13.490
<b>Reunion</b>

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.840
<b>What are you plotting?</b>

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.960
<b>I don't understand.</b>

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:18.630
<b>Didn't I tell you
that trying to control spirits</b>

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.340
<b>beyond the means
of your Furyoku can be fatal?</b>

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:22.600
<b><i><i>Shut up.</i></i></b>

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.680
<b><i><i>Even I know that much.</i></i></b>

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:30.190
<b><i><i>I have no intention of throwing
my life away until I make my</i> fuki <i>field.</i></i></b>

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:33.310
<b><i><i>That's what makes me different from Ren.</i></i></b>

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:36.070
<b><i><i>The problem is what to do now though.</i></i></b>

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.070
<b><i><i>I can't make
an Over Soul with them all at once.</i></i></b>

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:43.740
<b><i><i>But I should be able to handle them
one at a time with my Furyoku.</i></i></b>

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:46.370
<b><i><i>I'm limited to one attack with each.</i></i></b>

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.120
<b><i><i>This is a carefully laid-out plan.</i></i></b>

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:54.460
<b><i><i>So don't miss!</i></i></b>

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.760
<b>Bring it on!</b>

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.590
<b>Don't tell me you're scared?</b>

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:05.930
<b>Bill! This guy isn't a hero!</b>

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.770
<b>Those who don't know
fear or pain will never grow!</b>

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:11.440
<b>He is just…</b>

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:14.690
<b>a fool!</b>

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:16.650
<b>Let's go, Kororo!</b>

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.190
<b>KauKau Priwenpe!</b>

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:22.660
<b>This isn't even worth
dodging or hitting away!</b>

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.200
<b>Just keep charging, Blocks!</b>

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.780
<b>Hook, line, and sinker!</b>

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.120
<b>Back, Kororo!</b>

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:31.040
<b>Now, Over Soul!</b>

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.630
<b>Water spirit, Vodyanoy!</b>

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.840
<b>Give me your strength!</b>

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.670
<b>This is…</b>

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:45.140
<b>Water is wrapped around the hailstones!</b>

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.180
<b>Back, Vodyanoy!</b>

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.930
<b>Next up, Over Soul!</b>

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.770
<b>Badbh!</b>

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:00.940
<b>He turned it into giant icicles!</b>

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:06.740
<b>Remarkable!</b>

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:10.120
<b>An Over Soul combination making use
of each spirit's unique attributes!</b>

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:21.880
<b>I have to give it to you!
You're surprisingly good!</b>

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:26.390
<b>But all you destroyed was Die Saurus,
not the actual Blocks!</b>

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:33.390
<b>Die Block! Die Tank, complete!</b>

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:49.950
<b><i>The sea?</i></b>

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:54.620
<b>Dumbass.</b>

00:04:56.420 --> 00:05:00.210
<b><i><i>I made this course
just to drive you into the ocean.</i></i></b>

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.920
<b>Out of walls made with Mososo Kruppe.</b>

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.140
<b>But Badbh though…</b>

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:10.100
<b>How the hell did Pino</b>

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.810
<b>handle such a crazy spirit so well?</b>

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:16.600
<b>Turning seawater into an iceberg
in an instant…</b>

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:21.730
<b>However strong he is, he won't
be going anywhere for a while like that!</b>

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:23.860
<b>Overcoming the Furyoku barrier to win…</b>

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:27.910
<b>Now that is intelligence and ingenuity!
That is the Shaman Fight!</b>

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.410
<b>Superb, Horohoro!</b>

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.450
<b>Horohoro!</b>

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.910
<b>Over Soul! Deht the Viking!</b>

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.460
<b>Now I'm going to smash you
into a million pieces.</b>

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.380
<b>That's what I would say.</b>

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.300
<b>But I'm all out of Furyoku.</b>

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.930
<b>Be grateful that Deht is so damn strong.</b>

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.520
<b>I win.</b>

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:10.700
<b>Dozens and dozens of rat spirits…</b>

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:12.870
<b>So that's what Blocks really is.</b>

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:16.500
<b>He must have used Over Soul
on every last one to control them.</b>

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:21.000
<b>What to do about the Icemen though?</b>

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.300
<b>The best thing would be
to have Faust look at them,</b>

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:28.550
<b>but I'm so beat I can't take them myself.</b>

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.770
<b><i>Horohoro is out late.</i></b>

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.900
<b>He's probably loitering around somewhere.</b>

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.900
<b>He likes doing things alone sometimes.</b>

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:51.240
<b>He was really brooding things over.</b>

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.910
<b>I mean, he didn't even
crack a smile at my joke.</b>

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.910
<b>That's just because your jokes are lame.</b>

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.660
<b>Really?</b>

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.420
<b>Why don't you try it out on us, Chocolove?</b>

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.540
<b>Cheesecake!</b>

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.460
<b>I don't really get it.</b>

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.510
<b>Oh, well…</b>

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:10.720
<b>Whatever the case,
he's still far too late, right?</b>

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:13.800
<b>We were all meant to meet here
to hear this important thing</b>

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:16.510
<b>you have to tell us, Yoh.</b>

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:20.690
<b>Yeah. Shall we go look for him?</b>

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:24.150
<b>Wait. Despite everything,
he's still my teammate.</b>

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.570
<b>I'll go. Come with me, Chocolove.</b>

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:29.900
<b>Right! Sure thing, Ren!</b>

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:38.950
<b>Good evening,</b>

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:40.540
<b>everyone.</b>

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.750
<b>How dreadful.</b>

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:49.670
<b>We've come all the way here
because they are late only to find this.</b>

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:52.260
<b>Is he alive, Peyote?</b>

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:53.930
<b>Just about,</b>

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:56.260
<b>I guess.</b>

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:00.100
<b>Now, would you be so kind as to tell us
what the hell happened here,</b>

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:01.730
<b>Brocken?</b>

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:06.150
<b>What did you see
from inside that ice cube?</b>

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.760
<b>It was the X-Laws…</b>

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:11.900
<b>What?</b>

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.030
<b>Yes. I'm sure of it!</b>

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:19.410
<b>It was all so sudden I could hardly tell,
but that was the X-Laws!</b>

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.750
<b><i>Just as Bill got to his feet,</i></b>

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.790
<b><i>there was one dazzling flash of light,
followed by another!</i></b>

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:32.880
<b>I'd never seen anything that can move
so fast before, but there's no doubt.</b>

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:34.340
<b>I'm certain…</b>

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.820
<b><i>It was an angel.</i></b>

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:38.850
<b><i>An angel?</i></b>

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.270
<b>Strange.</b>

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:45.100
<b>If this really was the X-Laws' doing,</b>

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:47.230
<b>Bill has already been executed.</b>

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.440
<b>We'll likely need to confirm it.</b>

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:53.740
<b>It doesn't matter that Bill's
been taken out,</b>

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:58.320
<b>but at the same time,
this was an attack on Lord Hao.</b>

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:04.040
<b>Revenge. We'll kill whoever did this
as soon as we catch them.</b>

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:09.960
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.920
<b>I've obtained an incredible new power.</b>

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:20.220
<b>I'm sorry, Marco!</b>

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:25.140
<b>Lyserg Diethel. I'm not blind, you know.</b>

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.480
<b>It seems you're not fully on board</b>

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.980
<b>with Asakura Yoh's resignation.</b>

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.190
<b>Because… he's my friend.</b>

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:38.820
<b>And there's a mystery I can't solve.
It keeps him in my heart.</b>

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.830
<b>What do you doubt?</b>

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.330
<b>That killing</b>

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.040
<b><i>is really justice.</i></b>

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:49.540
<b>How many times must I tell you?</b>

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:53.630
<b>The moment one allows a sinner to go
unpunished, the rule of law collapses</b>

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:56.090
<b>and evil spreads through the land.</b>

00:09:56.670 --> 00:10:00.850
<b>I know. But my heart
just can't accept that.</b>

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.470
<b>Of their own volition,</b>

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:06.890
<b>Venstar, Kevin, and Meene
died for Ms. Maiden.</b>

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:12.320
<b>I have no way of knowing what is in
the hearts of those who go to die,</b>

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:15.150
<b>but voluntarily choosing death</b>

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:18.820
<b>means to kill your own heart,
at the very least.</b>

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:22.530
<b>Kill… your heart?</b>

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.660
<b>Have you forgotten
that these white uniforms we wear</b>

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:29.250
<b>are in fact our burial clothes?</b>

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:31.960
<b>I have something to show you.</b>

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.300
<b>Enter.</b>

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:39.930
<b>This is…</b>

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:41.890
<b>The X-Armory.</b>

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:46.430
<b>A store of weapons and intermediaries
for the coming war.</b>

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.350
<b>And…</b>

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:52.150
<b>the eighth angel, Zelel.</b>

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:54.400
<b>Your Spirit Ally.</b>

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:58.240
<b>My angel?</b>

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.740
<b>You're a bright child.</b>

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:05.280
<b>Take this sword of punishment,</b>

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.660
<b>cut out the doubt
from inside of you at once,</b>

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.080
<b>and join us as we smite the wicked.</b>

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:13.670
<b>I have high hopes for you!</b>

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:18.210
<b>The eighth angel, Zelel…</b>

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.470
<b>I was just heading out
to see how strong he was</b>

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:24.140
<b>when I saw Horohoro and the others.</b>

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.180
<b>So you went to help them, huh?</b>

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:30.430
<b>Yoh?</b>

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:32.230
<b>Faust.</b>

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.440
<b>How are the Icemen doing?</b>

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.070
<b>I've treated all of their wounds,</b>

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.490
<b>but the hygiene here is very poor.</b>

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:43.990
<b>It's probably best to contact an Officiant
and have them moved somewhere clean.</b>

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.490
<b>We can always count on you.
Okay, let's do that now.</b>

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:48.910
<b>Don't count on them!</b>

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:53.250
<b>The Shaman Fight is a battle
to choose just one king.</b>

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:57.040
<b>You think they'll bother
looking after everyone desperate for help?</b>

00:11:57.960 --> 00:11:59.800
<b>They're shady, the Patch.</b>

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.670
<b>Magna and Nichrom.</b>

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.050
<b>No doubt the important thing
you have to tell us tonight</b>

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:11.020
<b>involves them somehow, right?</b>

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:13.390
<b>Yeah. It does.</b>

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.480
<b>What's this? An important thing?</b>

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:20.360
<b>It's good that you're here.
You listen too, Lyserg.</b>

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:23.780
<b>It's about our future
and the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:31.660
<b>Found you!</b>

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:51.430
<b>This is what I call a massacre!</b>

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.180
<b>Bastard!</b>

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:59.270
<b>You nearly hurt Lyserg, asshole!</b>

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:04.070
<b>So the sneak attack was a failure.</b>

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.660
<b>Those guys!</b>

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:11.080
<b>Oh, well. What can you do?</b>

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:14.660
<b>You get what you give.</b>

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:18.750
<b>You get… what you give?</b>

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:22.300
<b>Sneaking up on us like that!</b>

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.050
<b>That damn near killed us!</b>

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.930
<b>So? What now?</b>

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:31.930
<b>Right. How about we just run away?</b>

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.730
<b>You do your best to get away, too, Ryu!</b>

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.440
<b>You got it, Yoh!</b>

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:43.570
<b>I'm going to help Ryu!</b>

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:44.940
<b>Forget it.</b>

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:49.740
<b>If you get your angel out,
they won't get out of this unscathed.</b>

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.990
<b>Then someone else
will come along to get even.</b>

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:54.830
<b>It will never end.</b>

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:01.920
<b>Your pals have left you behind.</b>

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.840
<b>Don't be sad, though.</b>

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.550
<b>They can't get away, anyway.</b>

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:07.880
<b>What?</b>

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:11.970
<b>To tell you the truth, one of us
had already snuck into that derelict hotel</b>

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.560
<b>before we launched our attack.</b>

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:19.480
<b>In other words, he's with
your fleeing friends right now,</b>

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:21.150
<b>high in the sky!</b>

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:33.080
<b>The fat one was hitching a free ride.</b>

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.620
<b>I thought that would happen, anyway.</b>

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:40.790
<b>That doesn't sit right with me.</b>

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:42.420
<b>What?</b>

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:42.420
<b>What?</b>

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:47.920
<b>Your friend falls out of the sky,
and you laugh like it's some funny joke.</b>

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:53.680
<b>People who don't value their friends
are no good!</b>

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:59.020
<b>Hey! Didn't your boss
tell you to run away?</b>

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:02.310
<b>But if you don't sit right with me,
you don't sit right.</b>

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.020
<b>Very well.</b>

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:11.030
<b>Kill him, Djinn!</b>

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.950
<b>Yes, master!</b>

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:18.620
<b>I hope Ryu's okay.</b>

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:23.710
<b>Like I said, don't worry, Lyserg.
Anyway, I want to ask you something.</b>

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:28.010
<b>What did you do with Morphin?</b>

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.420
<b>What?</b>

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.760
<b>Morphin's right here.</b>

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:39.930
<b><i>She's very dear to me.
My father gave her to me.</i></b>

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:43.400
<b>We would never part!</b>

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:46.520
<b>Cute!</b>

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:48.440
<b>What?</b>

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:49.820
<b>Nothing.</b>

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.570
<b>You say some strange things, Yoh.</b>

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.880
<b>Master Yoh!</b>

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.220
<b>What gives?</b>

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.760
<b>I just noticed you were gone.
Where did you go?</b>

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:20.020
<b>That darn Ryu! I knew it…</b>

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:26.690
<b>Sorry. I've got to go somewhere.
You go on ahead to the usual inn.</b>

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:30.400
<b>What about this important thing?</b>

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.070
<b>I'll let you know when I get back.</b>

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:33.700
<b>Yoh!</b>

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:41.200
<b>Over Soul. Amidamaru in Harusame,
in the Futsu-no-Mitama sword!</b>

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.210
<b>Spirit of Sword!</b>

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:54.800
<b>Yoh really is something else!</b>

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:57.430
<b>Where could he be off to in such a hurry?</b>

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:01.270
<b>How would I know? Maybe he's having
a dinner date with his fiancée.</b>

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:09.400
<b>What's the matter?
It's like you can't even get going.</b>

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:10.900
<b>Shut your trap!</b>

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.530
<b>Keep it coming, dork!</b>

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.870
<b><i><i>Nothing I do works.</i></i></b>

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:21.450
<b><i><i>I've really dropped myself
in it this time.</i></i></b>

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:28.500
<b>You get what you give?</b>

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.130
<b>You think it's ready?</b>

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:34.130
<b>No, not by a long shot!</b>

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:38.390
<b>Thorough cooking is key
to Mickey's Special Barbecue.</b>

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:43.560
<b>My mom and dad aren't around,
so this is my first time camping.</b>

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:47.230
<b>It's kind of like you're my dad, Mickey.</b>

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:51.730
<b>Then feel free to call me Dad, Redseb.</b>

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:53.070
<b>In which case--</b>

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:58.610
<b>Hey, Seyram! Get over here!
This is going to be delicious!</b>

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:02.030
<b>Seyram?</b>

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.170
<b>Ryu!</b>

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.170
<b>Come on, wake up!</b>

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.170
<b>Now's not the time for a snooze, dumbass!</b>

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:19.260
<b>Your yelling is wasted.</b>

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:21.430
<b>He'll be dead soon.</b>

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:22.680
<b>What?</b>

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:25.770
<b>I said to kill him.</b>

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:29.440
<b>Djinn are magical beings that always
carry out their masters' orders</b>

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:31.360
<b>to the fullest degree.</b>

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:40.780
<b><i><i>Where am I?</i></i></b>

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:46.950
<b><i><i>I thought I recognized it.
I know what this is.</i></i></b>

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.920
<b><i><i>I'm dead!</i></i></b>

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:55.550
<b><i><i>Whoa… Looks like
the welcoming party is here.</i></i></b>

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:59.340
<b><i><i>And it's a party of magnificent Buddhas!</i></i></b>

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:02.590
<b><i><i>Look at them all. One, two, three…</i></i></b>

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:05.560
<b><i><i>Incredible!</i></i></b>

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:07.640
<b><i><i>Before I died,</i></i></b>

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:10.060
<b><i><i>all I wanted</i></i></b>

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:14.400
<b><i><i>was to bag myself
a gorgeous bride like Yoh did!</i></i></b>

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:17.530
<b><i><i>I…</i></i></b>

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:21.740
<b><i><i>don't want to die yet!</i></i></b>

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.920
<b>How dare you?</b>

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.550
<b>Stop it! We're out of our depth here.</b>

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.050
<b>What?</b>

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:47.060
<b>It seems we're destined
to always be interrupted by someone.</b>

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:50.930
<b>And always by people
who totally outclass us.</b>

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:54.190
<b>But to think a group whose every member</b>

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:56.610
<b>has a Kami-class spirit
would butt in this time…</b>

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:58.570
<b>It's Gandhara!</b>

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:05.120
<b><i><i>Gandhara… One of the three great powers!</i></i></b>

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:08.290
<b>Ryunosuke.</b>

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.580
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:12.580
<b><i><i>How did she know my name?</i></i></b>

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:16.840
<b>We dislike futile conflict and slaughter.</b>

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.460
<b><i>Yet we saved you</i></b>

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:22.050
<b><i>because we heard the wish
of a compassionate heart</i></b>

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:24.220
<b><i>to help you.</i></b>

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:28.140
<b><i>Thank him.</i></b>

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:33.140
<b>We'll get you back next time!</b>

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.650
<b>Lady.</b>

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:40.730
<b>Now, I'll see you at the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.200
<b>Beautiful…</b>

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:47.030
GUEST HOUSE

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:51.250
<b>Man, you guys really took
one hell of a licking, Pino!</b>

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:55.290
<b>Shut it! You don't have
to keep bringing that up, asshole!</b>

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:02.710
<b>Don't worry about it, Mic.</b>

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:06.130
<b>I was just thinking about the past.</b>

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:14.390
<b><i><i>Lulu,</i></i></b>

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.100
<b><i><i>Ben, Eve,</i></i></b>

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:19.400
<b><i><i>Lynn…</i></i></b>

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:24.990
<b>I know! Shall we go see
all the Shaft guys?</b>

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:45.670
<b>They're all dead.</b>

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:48.010
<b>Why?</b>

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:51.100
<b>Who? Who did this?</b>

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:56.940
<b>I did it. I've found you at last.</b>

00:21:57.020 --> 00:22:00.150
<b>I never expected
you'd be here on this island.</b>

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:02.230
<b>You bastard!</b>

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:04.230
<b>How could you do that to my friends?</b>

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:09.280
<b>You're the ones
who killed our dad that Christmas night!</b>

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:12.200
<b>Die.</b>

